+// for one row and reduces 1/n_tok of the payload for n_tok rows. It would NOT fail:
+// NCCL reduces the prefix it was given, returns success, and rows 1..n_tok-1 keep this
+// rank's unreduced partial. Every rank would then continue from a different residual
+// stream and the output would be fluent and wrong — the same shape of defect as the
+// capability-flag bug this engine already shipped once.
